        (8 8 8 8 8 8 8 0 0 0 3 0 3 8)
        (8 8 8 8 8 8 8 0 0 0 3 3 3 8)
        (8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8))))
    (witness diag-blank borderline concept
