      (separates "A 6x6 panel with a 3x3 motif at its top-left meets a blank 6x6 panel at one corner. The concept tiles the first panel and leaves the blank one unchanged; $DiagPanel joins them into one piece and tiles the motif across both, so it stays defined under $ColorBox and $CornerBox.")
